internal/merkleinventory/TRACEABILITY.md:23:| §11.4 MIXED-NS-EXCHANGE missing Checkpoint/Descriptor walk | `MissingObjectIDs` → `walkMissing`; `FetchObjects` → `ObjectSource.ObjectsGet`; `Index.AddJSON` / `AddBlob` | `TestInProcessExchangeWalksChangedNamespacesAndFetchesExactObjects` checks only record/manifest/blob root deltas, exact missing IDs, validated adds, record-before-blob ordering, and six literal roots of its real-byte fixture | The combined normative fixture's synthetic `Z(3)` / `T(2)` IDs have no supplied bytes; this package does not manufacture SHA-256 preimages. Its exact combined normative root assertion is not claimed. Durable sync transaction is not present here. |
