(production and test). `provhost` remains 5→5. `rpcwire` is 3→4 because the
new package calls it (production and test). The inventory package is new and
has no importing package. No `rpcwire` production source or validator was
modified.

Moved validator classes: complete Tombstone and Tombstone Acknowledgement
shapes move from explicit fail-closed refusal to canonicaljson identity
admission; their schema namespace remains unchanged. Four other mapped rows
remain fail-closed. No traceability registry row was edited; the Story final
leaf owns that registry.

