 - IMPLEMENTATION: `internal/merkleinventory` adds deterministic Section 11.4 roots/children, schema-owned membership, bounded `inventory.roots` / `inventory.children` / `objects.get`, and in-process differing-node retrieval. Section 10.7 Tombstone and Acknowledgement identity validation now admits their complete closed shapes; acknowledgement admission requires its stored Tombstone and matching subject. No Host Channel handler or capability advertisement was added.
